y":"Hello,\n\nI would like to report a recurring issue I’ve been experiencing with Trae.\n\nQuite frequently, after very long processing times, the system returns a “complete” status but provides no actual output. This results in wasted time and unnecessary credit consumption. I have already submitted a bug report through Trae itself, but unfortunately this issue continues to happen on a weekly basis.\n\nThis is becoming increasingly disruptive to my workflow. At the very least, it would be extremely helpful if the system could check for service instability or known issues before allowing users to start a session. That way, we wouldn’t lose both time and credits when the system is not operating properly.\n\nI’d appreciate clarification on:\n\nWhether this is a known issue\n\nIf there is a fix or workaround available\n\nWhether credits can be refunded in such cases\n\nIf a system status check can be implemented before session start\n\nPlease let me know how this will be addressed.\n\nThank you,\nUlas\nulascakir@gmail.com","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/2296/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/2296/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null},"comments":[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/comments/3966184132","html_url":"https://github.com/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/2296#issuecomment-3966184132","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/2296","id":3966184132,"node_id":"IC_kwDONiYvnc7sZyrE","user":{"login":"traewx","id":231598473,"node_id":"U_kgDODc3piQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/231598473?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/traewx","html_url":"https://github.com/traewx","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/traewx/followers","following_url":"https://a